This project is a frontend extraction of the Rakazo web and Expo applications.
Rakazo is Copyright 2026 the Rakazo authors and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/elie222/rakazo
Upstream commit: c9375d4291d19ac35bbfe826255d19d976c81c38

Files under apps/web, apps/mobile, packages/ui-web, packages/ui-tokens,
packages/chat-ui, packages/contracts, and packages/core are derived from that
commit. Package names were changed from @rakazo/* to @tampletgrok/*. Unless a
file says it was modified or added by Tampletgrok, treat it as that upstream
source with the package-name change.

The following were added by Tampletgrok and are not upstream Rakazo code:

- packages/mock-adapters
- packages/contracts/src/adapters.ts
- packages/ui-tokens/src/brand.ts
- examples/api-integration
- docs/
- the demo session in apps/web/src/lib/auth.ts
- the demo procedure client in apps/web/src/lib/rpc.ts
- the standalone Vite config in apps/web/vite.config.ts

Tampletgrok does not claim ownership of unmodified upstream code. The Apache
License 2.0 is in the LICENSE file. The Rakazo name remains the name of the
upstream project; it is not the default product name of this template.

The orange assistant mark in packages/ui-tokens/assets/AppIcon.icon is the
upstream icon source, renamed only as a path. Review it before you ship a
product that uses a different brand.

Lonora mobile modifications
Copyright 2026 Lonora contributors

Source reference: https://github.com/loorksy/Tampletgrok
Reference revision: 20fc9ac862bb833d1578968a7aba5ea18ff88a29
Modified components: simplified classic assistant avatar, Inbox layout metrics
and colors, and native Inbox-to-thread navigation adapted to the Lonora API.
Native-only notifications, demo adapters, spaces, billing and computer screens
are excluded. Session authentication, bilingual labels, group creation, uploads
and shared-runtime run controls are implemented for Lonora.
The complete Apache License 2.0 is included at the repository root in LICENSE.
